              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4636' id='15' type-v2='text' w='91644' x='571' y='6364'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>This view shows the features effecting estimation of orders per country. Feature importances are not comparable between countries.</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Due to the nature of feature type and Local insight combinations. Competitors which have don&apos;t have either Local Insight or numeric feature type will be excluded.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6091' id='33' type-v2='text' w='91644' x='571' y='93182'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Feature Types:</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10' italic='true'>&#10;Numeric features: </run>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Represent our external data providers&apos; metrics. Such as Data.ai, Similar web, Google etc</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10' italic='true'>Time features</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10' italic='true'>: Represent the seasonality effect that our brand has faced. This is checked and applied to competitor order estimation as well</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
