                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Book'>This view shows the latest local insights countries have provided in last 2 years. </run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Book'>These Local insights are being fed to the model in order to scale the results depending on their reliability. </run>
